    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739070/extras/2881d5db9f30ce1fe1909edbe2b3c288.avif?t=1755722413\" width=685 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Fall of Juliet</strong> is a mature game about desire, temptation, and personal power. You play as Juliet, a thoughtful young woman whose life begins to unravel when a mysterious force starts pulling her away from the world she once knew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juliet\u2019s journey is shaped by your choices. Will she resist the pull of seductive darkness, or explore it and uncover strength in the parts of herself she never dared to face? Every decision opens a new path, and each path reveals more of who she is or who she might become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about ownership of identity. Whether Juliet holds onto her ideals or redefines herself through passion, influence, or ambition, the choice is always hers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739070/extras/5faa34f2ed2afbeb1c2c81426c402faa.avif?t=1755722413\" width=685 height=242 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Fiery City, where dreams glow and shadows whisper, Juliet lives a quiet, well-ordered life. She is thoughtful, principled, and untouched by the games others play. But something has changed. A presence has entered her life. It is charming, dangerous, and impossible to ignore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It is the story of a woman standing at the edge of temptation, asked to make choices that challenge everything she thought she believed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the world around her grows more uncertain, Juliet is offered paths she never imagined. Some are beautiful. Some are dark. All are hers to take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739070/extras/013a7225ce5f576903e0df0fdead650e.poster.avif?t=1755722413\" width=650 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739070/extras/013a7225ce5f576903e0df0fdead650e.webm?t=1755722413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739070/extras/013a7225ce5f576903e0df0fdead650e.mp4?t=1755722413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
